letter.body:
Dear Mr. Lu, dear Ms. Wan,

I am writing on behalf of KVANT (Russia) to follow up on our request for quotation dated 11 October 2025 for a special automatic tankhouse crane, which we understand is still being priced by your team. We remain interested in your proposal and would like to reactivate this request and, importantly, extend its scope.

Project background. KVANT is preparing a bid for the Basic Engineering and equipment package of a new Roasting–Leaching–Electrowinning complex (OVE-75) at Kola MMC, Monchegorsk, Murmansk region, Russia (Nornickel group), producing 75,000 t/a of LME-grade copper cathodes. The electrowinning tankhouse comprises 180 polymer-concrete cells in 2 series x 90 cells (internal cell size approx. 8,485 x 1,155 x 1,650 mm, 84 cathodes / 85 anodes per cell, permanent stainless-steel cathode technology, series current up to 47 kA). We are aware of your deliveries of tankhouse mechanization packages, including the Huludao Hongyue North Copper 150,000 t/a plant, and believe your product range matches this project well.

Extended scope. In addition to the crane position, we invite your budget proposals for the complete tankhouse mechanization package:
1) Robotic cathode stripping machine, 120 cathodes/h: two-stage hot washing, stripping with separation of the two deposit plates WITHOUT joining at the bottom edge, machine-vision quality control with an electronic register of cathode blanks, automatic sampling, weighing, bale forming 2,500 +/- 50 kg with strapping and marking.
2) Two (2) special automatic tankhouse cranes: automatic positioning driven by the harvesting schedule of the plant control system, removal/installation of cell covers, harvesting of 1/3 of cathodes per cycle with drip pause, tooling and wetted metal parts in AISI 316L, on-crane infrared short-circuit detection. (This item updates and supersedes our RFQ of 11 October 2025.)
3) Cathode blank (starter sheet) preparation line — straightening, edge trimming and preparation; please also state your solution for maintenance/straightening of stainless-steel permanent cathode blanks and for automatic edge-strip application, and whether this line is included in the stripping machine supply or offered separately.
4) Anode preparation and anode washing machines configured for long-life lead-alloy anodes (electrowinning service).
5) Cathode bale forming, weighing, marking and strapping equipment, if offered separately from the stripping machine.

Controls note: under the end customer's automation standard, PLC and SCADA must be of Russian origin. Please quote the machines with open control interfaces (I/O and signal lists, Modbus / Industrial Ethernet) and confirm readiness either to integrate with a Russian control system or to hand over the controls documentation accordingly.

Qualification package. To progress Jiangxi Tianxin as a nominated equipment partner in our bid, kindly provide together with the budget proposals:
- reference list of tankhouse projects for the last 10–15 years (project, customer, capacity, scope of supply, commissioning year) with customer contacts for verification, including the acceptance certificate and customer contact for the Huludao Hongyue project;
- audited financial statements for 2023–2025;
- business license (USCC) and confirmation of export registration; evidence of previous export deliveries (customs declaration numbers), especially any deliveries to Russia;
- ISO 9001:2015 certificate copy and any other management-system certificates; your two invention patents (numbers and subjects);
- confirmation of production facilities (workshop area, key machine tools, load plan 2026–2028) and consent to a factory audit by KVANT and/or the end customer;
- confirmation of readiness to act as a nominated subcontractor / equipment partner: draft teaming agreement, manufacturer's authorization, consent to use your name and references in our bid, and the name of the bank able to issue advance-payment and performance guarantees;
- experience with Russian technical norms (GOST) and documentation in Russian/English, or confirmation of readiness to work under KVANT's normative control;
- erection supervision, commissioning and operator/maintenance training at site (Monchegorsk, Arctic region): team composition, indicative man-day rates, visa readiness;
- a 2-year operational spare-parts package (not less than 10% and at least 1 pc of each item) quoted as a separate line;
- scope of technical documentation to be transferred with the right of modification for localization, and draft FAT/SAT programs for the stripping machine and cranes.

Commercial terms: please quote FOB China and DAP Monchegorsk options with delivery schedules; settlement in CNY; the contract would be signed with KVANT (Russia), end user Kola MMC (Nornickel group) — we ask you to confirm your compliance clearance for this end customer at an early stage, so that neither side loses time.

We would appreciate your acknowledgement within one week and your proposals and documents within three weeks. We are ready for a video call with your engineers at short notice and, at a later stage, to visit your facility in Nanchang.

Best regards,
[Name, position]
KVANT
